},{"name":"Virtuosa","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Viviana","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Viy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vulcan","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vulpisfoglia","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"W","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Waai Fu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wakaba Mutsumi","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wang","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wanqing","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Warfarin","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Warmy","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Weedy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whislash","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whisperain","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wild Mane","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wind Chimes","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windflit","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windscoot","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wiš'adel","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wulfenite","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Xingzhu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yahata Umiri","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yato","rarity":2,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yu","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yūtenji Nyamu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima the Raging Tide","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zinogre S Catapult","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zuo Le","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"techniqueUnitIcons":{},"techniqueBranchOperators":{},"techniqueGroupOperators":{},"techniqueRelatedOperators":{},"forms":null,"skillRanges":{"2":{"skillName":"Double Hook","baseRangeId":"3-2","baseRange":{"cols":4,"rows":1,"opCell":[1,1],"rangeCells":[[1,2],[1,3],[1,4]]},"levelRangeIds":["4-1","4-1","4-1","4-1","4-1","4-1","4-1","4-1","4-1","4-1"],"grids":{"4-1":{"cols":5,"rows":1,"opCell":[1,1],"rangeCells":[[1,2],[1,3],[1,4],[1,5]]}},"changesAt":[]}},"overviewRanges":[{"elite":0,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":3,"rows":1,"opCell":[1,1],"rangeCells":[[1,2],[1,3]]}},{"elite":1,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":4,"rows":1,"opCell":[1,1],"rangeCells":[[1,2],[1,3],[1,4]]}}],"voiceData":{"textLocale":"en","lines":[{"id":"CN_001","title":"Appointed as Assistant","text":"Doc~tor~, you didn't forget anything, did you?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":1},{"id":"CN_002","title":"Talk 1","text":"Picking pockets to feed myself? Yeah, that was how I grew up. I didn't exactly have a choice. I woulda starved to death otherwise.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":2},{"id":"CN_003","title":"Talk 2","text":"If you want sturdy grappling hooks, the key thing's a good rope. Hm? Why do I like my hook so much? Well, go scale a building with your bare hands and you'll see.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"Fine, fine, your word's the word, Doctor. Can I go back to my room now? I've got stuff coming up. What? Still no? C'mooon, cut me some slack! Pleasie please?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Talk after Promotion 1","text":"If it wasn't you Rhodes Island, I'd probably still be rotting in jail. Say, how'd you find me anyway? Hmm… Maybe you heard about my skill through the grapevine?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Talk after Promotion 2","text":"There's lots of ways if you wanna survive in the slums, though more people simply die without a way at all. Never had much of a choice myself. Hope you can understand, Doctor.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":6},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"My parents kicked me out, and I had to fend for myself on the streets. Compared to my days in the gutter, life at Rhodes Island is a massive improvement.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"Saw a lot of people get same disease as mine who didn't end well. I kinda gave up on myself too, until I got lucky enough to be found by you guys… Tell me straight, Doctor. You can cure me, right? You...you can't? *Sigh*, I can live with that, I guess.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"Before, I was always looking for the next meal. Now I can really eat my fill. Gotta hand it to you, Rhodes Island's alright in my book. Huh? You wanna hear me say 'thank you'? Nah-ah, in, your, dreams. *Gasp*, I just said it...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"Ugh, this chair... ahhh….dangit... so comfy...!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"The name's Rope, nice to meet ya. Oh, here's your ID card, don't forget it. Huh? Why do I have it? That's a se-cret!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"Does watching this stuff actually help?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"C'mon, lets talk about payment. Promotions are cool, but my salary is what really matters.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Promotion 2","text":"Fine, fine. Now that I've got my due, I guess I should give my best.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":14},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"All right, coming!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"I'm doing captain biz? I would've asked for a bonus usually, but I can let this slide since it's you.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"Look at the map and figure out your route before we get in there. This is experience talking.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"So, what kind of good stuff will our enemies be carrying today?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"I don't really do straight-up fights.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"Put me to good use, ooo-kaaay?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"Sneaky sneaky…","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"Hmm, is this a good spot?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"Aha!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"Good, good, a little closer!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_027","title":"In Battle 3","text":"Huuugh!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":27},{"id":"CN_028","title":"In Battle 4","text":"Once I hook you, you're not getting away.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":28},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"A lot more excitement on that one than usual! A lot more profit too... whoo-hoo~!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"It'd be a waste to leave all that good stuff here. The enemies don't need them anyway, right?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"Some of 'em got away? Just leave them be. They might turn over a new leaf, who knows.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"Hey! Let's just bug out now, Doctor! We must save ourselves first!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"Is there an air vent in this room? Nothing, just curious.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"Aaaagh! Am I under arrest?!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"I mean, I'd like to figure out how a normal girl lives sometime... but, you know... I mean, maybe that's not really me?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_038","title":"New Year's blessing","text":"Piping hot food, big wide smiles, piles and piles of presents... It's the kind of scene I would only be able to steal glances at through windows. Thank you, Doctor... Aw, c'mon, I was being serious there! Anyway... happy New Year.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":38},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"Hiiii, Doctor.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42},{"id":"CN_043","title":"Birthday","text":"Happy birthday. Got your present here. Go ahead. Yep, it <i>was</i> your wallet, until the moment I took it from your pocket. No harm in giving it to you here as <i>my</i> present, right? Okay, okay, jokes are over, now look inside. I spent forever hand-drawing the card, y'know?","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":43},{"id":"CN_044","title":"Anniversary Celebration","text":"Yeah, yeah, I know. I've been at Rhodes Island so long, I oughta get used to my new life already. I'm gonna stop crawling through the vents, and I'm really gonna cut down on stealing stuff as a prank... Doctor, do you think, that after so many field missions—I've learned to use my skills for the better?","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":44}],"packs":[{"id":"en","label":"English","actors":["Claire Morgan"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-english/58e999c42e9fb00832d571ab35a1666000557088/current/char_236_rope/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"jp","label":"Japanese","actors":["Chiyuki Miura"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/15ab8a81f1fc3b7e9b5486cf00c5afdc4b948649/current/char_236_rope/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"cn","label":"Mandarin","actors":["Kiiki"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-mandarin/88535cc2a7c43056f2c370850184545b8c478a43/current/char_236_rope/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"kr","label":"Korean","actors":["Lee Sae-byeok"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-korean/38e75788058bbbbc5b17330a1591245fbb08f822/current/char_236_rope/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"old_jp","label":"Legacy JP","actors":["Ayumi Fujimura"],"status":"legacy","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/15ab8a81f1fc3b7e9b5486cf00c5afdc4b948649/legacy/49321c40e27f9293cd0b2d0c7b446796be74ab1b/char_236_rope/{voiceId}.mp3"}]}}}